RESTO Add Spiritmender
    Events
        Unit - A unit Acquires an item
    Conditions
        (Item-type of (Item being manipulated)) Equal to Spiritmender
    Actions
        -------- This is like the slow one, but it would increase the level of shockwave when you already have it --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ELEMENTAL_Stormcaller (Specialization) for (Triggering unit)) Less than 1
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Earthwarden (Specialization) for (Triggering unit)) Less than 1
                (Level of RESTORATION_Spiritmender (Specialization) for (Triggering unit)) Less than 1
                (Level of TOTEMIC_Totemist (Specialization) for (Triggering unit)) Less than 1
            Then - Actions
                Game - Display to (All players) the text: (New specialization learned:  + (Name of (Item being manipulated)))
                Unit - Add RESTORATION_Spiritmender (Specialization) to (Triggering unit)
                -------- Make ability permanent --------
                Custom script:   call UnitMakeAbilityPermanent(GetTriggerUnit(), true, 'A6A2')
                Custom script:   call UnitMakeAbilityPermanent(GetTriggerUnit(), true, 'A6A8')
                Sound - Play NewAbility <gen>
            Else - Actions
                Game - Display to (All players) the text: ((Proper name of (Triggering unit)) +  already has specialization!)
                Sound - Play Error <gen>
